<title>AUSTRALIA: Rugby league-Super League club championship results.</title>
<headline>Rugby league-Super League club championship results.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Super League world club championship matches.</p>
<p>Played Monday:</p>
<p> Canterbury	  18  Wigan		22</p>
<p>Played Sunday:</p>
<p> Canberra	    70  Halifax	     6</p>
<p> Warrington	  12  Cronulla	   40</p>
<p> Adelaide	    50  Salford	     8</p>
